WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.459
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.729 --> 01:43.950
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.140 --> 01:46.789
[Episode 26]

4
01:53.990 --> 01:54.470
[Chen Junnan]

5
01:57.289 --> 01:59.020
[Beijing International Hotel]

6
01:58.680 --> 02:00.920
We're now on Chang'an Avenue,

7
02:01.280 --> 02:02.280
eating corn.

8
02:02.400 --> 02:03.760
Two kilometers ahead

9
02:03.760 --> 02:05.230
is Tian'anmen Square.

10
02:06.760 --> 02:07.560
Uncle Che,

11
02:07.870 --> 02:09.530
we've arrived at Tian'anmen.

12
02:09.810 --> 02:11.520
[Long live the Republic of China! Long Live the Unity of the Peoples of the World!]

13
02:11.840 --> 02:13.910
I've brought Uncle Che to see the sea!

14
02:14.190 --> 02:14.960
Look,

15
02:15.030 --> 02:16.190
Shichahai.

16
02:16.310 --> 02:17.470
I see it, Uncle Che.

17
02:24.870 --> 02:25.560
Two,

18
02:25.560 --> 02:26.400
one,

19
02:26.630 --> 02:28.000
cheese!

20
02:38.160 --> 02:39.130
[Gulou West Street]

21
02:42.660 --> 02:47.720
[Thank you very much for taking care of my dad.]

22
02:53.680 --> 02:56.360
I'm planning to build the factory

23
02:56.360 --> 02:57.750
in Yushu County, Fucheng.

24
02:57.750 --> 02:59.120
Because the rent there

25
02:59.120 --> 03:00.680
is at least one-sixth cheaper

26
03:00.680 --> 03:01.870
than in Shenyang.

27
03:02.310 --> 03:03.710
Plus, the local government

28
03:03.710 --> 03:05.030
offers some policy incentives,

29
03:05.030 --> 03:07.000
which could reduce our costs

30
03:07.000 --> 03:08.110
by at least 30%.

31
03:08.710 --> 03:09.870
That's great.

32
03:11.870 --> 03:13.930
I'm not worried about the production

33
03:14.150 --> 03:15.910
of the neck massager.

34
03:16.000 --> 03:16.710
He's asked me to film.

35
03:16.710 --> 03:17.240
Mainly,

36
03:17.430 --> 03:18.840
r-regarding promotion...

37
03:18.840 --> 03:19.520
Look at him,

38
03:19.960 --> 03:20.680
Commissioner Chen.

39
03:20.680 --> 03:22.030
How do you plan to handle it?

40
03:22.030 --> 03:23.280
He wants to show you

41
03:23.280 --> 03:24.280
his hardworking side.

42
03:24.280 --> 03:25.590
Doing the opposite.

43
03:25.910 --> 03:27.280
He really spruced himself up

44
03:27.280 --> 03:28.079
this time.

45
03:28.120 --> 03:28.780
Look at him.

46
03:29.190 --> 03:29.960
He's looking

47
03:30.470 --> 03:31.630
so sharp.

48
03:32.840 --> 03:34.370
He's even had his hair done.

49
03:34.870 --> 03:36.930
I've never seen him look so polished.

50
03:37.360 --> 03:38.150
Uncle Che.

51
03:38.750 --> 03:40.350
What are you mumbling about?

52
03:41.150 --> 03:42.190
I can't speak?

53
03:44.400 --> 03:45.150
No.

54
03:45.150 --> 03:47.680
I wanted you to take

55
03:47.680 --> 03:48.470
the meeting minutes.

56
03:48.470 --> 03:49.800
But you're not only mumbling here,

57
03:49.800 --> 03:51.800
you're also filming yourself.

58
03:53.400 --> 03:54.460
It could expose us.

59
03:55.240 --> 03:55.970
Understood.

60
03:56.280 --> 03:57.120
I'll make sure the mission is completed.

61
03:57.120 --> 03:58.840
Thanks for your hard work, Uncle Che.

62
03:58.840 --> 04:00.030
Call me "comrade."

63
04:00.710 --> 04:02.910
Comrade Che, thanks for your hard work.

64
04:03.400 --> 04:04.840
Sorry about that, Professor Lin.

65
04:04.840 --> 04:05.800
It's okay.

66
04:06.150 --> 04:07.630
What's he mumbling about?

67
04:19.390 --> 04:28.410
[Congrats on finding a new direction. Keep going!]

68
04:29.390 --> 04:31.630
[Congrats on finding a new direction. Keep going!]

69
04:32.890 --> 04:33.140
[Che Mingming]

70
04:35.510 --> 04:36.159
Uncle Che.

71
04:36.480 --> 04:37.680
Is the big city fun?

72
04:39.360 --> 04:41.560
It is quite fun.

73
04:41.560 --> 04:42.560
It's just that...

74
04:42.600 --> 04:44.310
Isn't your job a bit too hard?

75
04:44.310 --> 04:46.040
You've never worked in a big city.

76
04:44.390 --> 04:53.850
[Traditional Beijing Fried Sauce Noodles]

77
04:46.040 --> 04:47.770
How would you know if it's hard?

78
04:49.680 --> 04:50.750
You're just lucky

79
04:52.000 --> 04:53.800
you have a generous boss now.

80
04:54.000 --> 04:54.800
Think about your...

81
04:54.800 --> 04:55.920
your last job.

82
04:56.510 --> 04:57.480
Every now and then,

83
04:57.480 --> 04:59.390
you'd sneak off to some little corner,

84
04:59.390 --> 05:00.390
find some old piece of cardboard,

85
05:00.390 --> 05:01.950
lie down on it, and secretly scroll through your phone.

86
05:01.950 --> 05:03.360
Didn't that make you feel pretty happy?

87
05:03.360 --> 05:04.750
Can you really compare the two?

88
05:04.750 --> 05:05.430
Am I right?

89
05:05.430 --> 05:06.480
How did you know?

90
05:06.870 --> 05:08.670
Did you put a camera over my head?

91
05:09.360 --> 05:10.760
Uncle Che, you're sharp.

92
05:11.040 --> 05:11.720
Eat more.

93
05:11.870 --> 05:13.240
Should I order another plate for you?

94
05:13.240 --> 05:14.190
It's not easy

95
05:14.480 --> 05:16.430
making money in a big city, and the cost of living is high.

96
05:16.430 --> 05:17.750
You should watch your spending.

97
05:17.750 --> 05:19.270
My salary is pretty good now.

98
05:19.270 --> 05:20.920
Besides, treating you to a meal

99
05:20.920 --> 05:21.720
is no big deal.

100
05:21.720 --> 05:23.750
Save when you should; spend when you must.

101
05:23.750 --> 05:24.360
If you've got

102
05:24.360 --> 05:25.680
some money to spare,

103
05:26.800 --> 05:28.040
you can help out your brother a little.

104
05:28.040 --> 05:29.600
Why would he need my help?

105
05:30.270 --> 05:31.360
He's been back at work for less than a month

106
05:31.360 --> 05:32.870
and hasn't gotten his salary yet.

107
05:32.870 --> 05:35.330
And he spent a lot on Jia Xin's medical bills.

108
05:35.950 --> 05:37.350
Jia Xin's medical bills?

109
05:37.750 --> 05:38.950
What happened to him?

110
05:39.600 --> 05:40.510
You don't know?

111
05:42.390 --> 05:43.190
No, I don't.

112
05:45.530 --> 05:50.400
[Your Strength Is Our Guiding Light]

113
05:45.920 --> 05:47.380
How are you feeling today?

114
05:47.680 --> 05:48.480
Much better.

115
05:50.920 --> 05:53.390
Does it still hurt when they change your dressing?

116
05:53.390 --> 05:54.190
Yes,

117
05:54.800 --> 05:56.560
but not as much as before.

118
05:56.870 --> 05:58.930
I can grit my teeth and get through it.

119
05:59.480 --> 06:01.190
Keep the wound clean

120
06:01.190 --> 06:02.120
and dry.

121
06:02.830 --> 06:03.830
More importantly,

122
06:03.830 --> 06:05.160
keep a good mindset.

123
06:05.480 --> 06:06.210
Zhengliang,

124
06:06.210 --> 06:08.490
[Xiaoximen Hospital Affiliated with Qikang Medical]

125
06:06.630 --> 06:07.510
don't worry.

126
06:08.070 --> 06:09.190
That kind of thing

127
06:08.490 --> 06:09.210
[Burn Ward]

128
06:09.240 --> 06:10.240
won't happen again.

129
06:09.270 --> 06:10.410
[Keep quiet]

130
06:11.120 --> 06:12.430
I've come to realize something.

131
06:12.430 --> 06:14.040
We only live once.

132
06:14.120 --> 06:15.190
I can't just give up,

133
06:15.190 --> 06:15.920
right?

134
06:20.190 --> 06:21.120
What's going on?

135
06:21.360 --> 06:22.290
Why are you back?

136
06:29.120 --> 06:29.920
How...

137
06:31.000 --> 06:31.750
How did you end up

138
06:31.750 --> 06:32.950
looking like this?

139
06:34.270 --> 06:37.830
You never know what life has in store.

140
06:38.360 --> 06:39.390
I went to take on

141
06:39.390 --> 06:40.480
the King of Hell.

142
06:40.480 --> 06:41.680
I won.

143
06:41.750 --> 06:42.950
Zhengliang saved me.

144
06:43.600 --> 06:45.060
Zhengguang, you're here.

145
06:48.600 --> 06:49.430
You guys talk.

146
07:15.190 --> 07:15.920
I'm full.

147
07:17.040 --> 07:17.560
Okay.

148
07:21.040 --> 07:22.170
How did you find out?

149
07:22.720 --> 07:23.920
Junnan told me.

150
07:24.680 --> 07:26.160
Why didn't you tell me?

151
07:27.160 --> 07:28.360
What for?

152
07:29.270 --> 07:31.730
I didn't want you worrying too much about me.

153
07:33.159 --> 07:34.480
That's not being a real friend.

154
07:34.480 --> 07:36.159
I'm not being a real friend?

155
07:36.360 --> 07:37.800
L-Look at the state I'm in.

156
07:37.800 --> 07:40.040
I-I was afraid I'd hold you back

157
07:40.040 --> 07:41.840
and stop you from getting ahead.

158
07:42.480 --> 07:43.070
I wouldn't

159
07:43.070 --> 07:45.130
just stand by and watch when you fall.

160
07:48.120 --> 07:50.360
Well, I got back up, didn't I?

161
07:51.190 --> 07:54.050
And I... haven't exactly made something of myself.

162
07:54.390 --> 07:55.450
It doesn't matter.

163
07:56.430 --> 07:57.950
Zhengguang, have a seat.

164
07:58.190 --> 07:59.520
Sit down and let's talk.

165
08:00.600 --> 08:02.240
I am... sitting.

166
08:02.270 --> 08:04.330
I've b-been sitting this whole time.

167
08:13.870 --> 08:14.630
Zhengguang.

168
08:16.160 --> 08:18.020
We want to get married next month.

169
08:28.870 --> 08:29.480
Well...

170
08:29.480 --> 08:30.720
You two haven't known each other long,

171
08:30.720 --> 08:31.430
and you're already talking about marriage?

172
08:31.430 --> 08:32.559
Isn't that too fast?

173
08:33.030 --> 08:33.669
I...

174
08:33.720 --> 08:36.120
Some connections aren't measured by time.

175
08:36.390 --> 08:38.190
It was love at first sight for us.

176
08:46.030 --> 08:47.290
L-Love at first sight?

177
08:49.390 --> 08:50.850
Love at first sight, okay.

178
08:54.360 --> 08:55.150
Are...

179
08:56.000 --> 08:58.080
Are you against us getting married?

180
08:58.550 --> 08:59.670
What are you talking about?

181
08:59.670 --> 09:00.870
Why would I be against it?

182
09:00.870 --> 09:02.400
What's there to be against?

183
09:02.480 --> 09:03.720
And who am I to object?

184
09:03.750 --> 09:04.550
I support it.

185
09:04.550 --> 09:05.810
I strongly support it.

186
09:06.840 --> 09:07.960
It's a good thing.

187
09:07.960 --> 09:09.360
Something to celebrate.

188
09:10.000 --> 09:10.860
Zhengguang...

189
09:12.750 --> 09:14.720
I didn't know how to tell you.

190
09:15.720 --> 09:16.440
I just...

191
09:16.440 --> 09:17.570
You could've sent me

192
09:17.960 --> 09:19.620
a WeChat message or called me.

193
09:19.870 --> 09:20.840
As a last resort, you could've

194
09:20.840 --> 09:22.480
written me a letter or even sent a carrier pigeon.

195
09:22.480 --> 09:23.960
What's so hard about telling me?

196
09:23.960 --> 09:26.120
You really know how to make things complicated.

197
09:26.120 --> 09:26.720
Listen,

198
09:26.720 --> 09:27.790
when I was in Beijing

199
09:27.790 --> 09:28.840
and heard what happened to you,

200
09:28.840 --> 09:30.030
I was so upset.

201
09:30.390 --> 09:31.910
It felt like the worst news imaginable.

202
09:31.910 --> 09:33.170
But then I came back...

203
09:33.910 --> 09:36.110
and now I've heard some wonderful news.

204
09:36.750 --> 09:38.680
I sincerely congratulate you two.

205
09:39.120 --> 09:40.720
I'm genuinely happy for you.

206
09:40.720 --> 09:41.390
Really.

207
09:42.600 --> 09:44.260
Congratulations in advance.

208
09:45.360 --> 09:47.960
You'd better invite me to the wedding banquet.

209
09:49.330 --> 09:52.420
[Your Health, Our Expertise]

210
09:52.440 --> 09:55.730
[Xiaoximen Hospital Affiliated with Qikang Medical]

211
10:07.320 --> 10:08.110
Let's chat.

212
10:09.440 --> 10:10.900
Can't you see I'm working?

213
10:11.600 --> 10:12.550
I know.

214
10:12.720 --> 10:13.840
I registered.

215
10:14.120 --> 10:16.520
Besides, you don't have patients waiting.

216
10:19.630 --> 10:20.440
You usually can't even be bothered

217
10:20.440 --> 10:21.600
to say a few words to me.

218
10:21.600 --> 10:23.240
You've only been in Beijing for a few days,

219
10:23.240 --> 10:24.440
and you miss me that much already?

220
10:24.440 --> 10:25.670
Don't flatter yourself.

221
10:25.670 --> 10:27.120
I just couldn't find anyone else to talk to.

222
10:27.120 --> 10:28.320
If there'd been even one other person available,

223
10:28.320 --> 10:30.520
I definitely wouldn't have come to you.

224
10:31.320 --> 10:32.920
Alright, tell me. What's up?

225
10:38.480 --> 10:40.510
Jia Xin and Gong Xue are getting married.

226
10:40.510 --> 10:41.840
Isn't that a good thing?

227
10:42.600 --> 10:44.910
We'll have to give them a wedding gift, right?

228
10:44.910 --> 10:46.000
I'm broke.

229
10:46.000 --> 10:47.330
Can you lend me 800 yuan?

230
10:48.030 --> 10:48.840
No!

231
10:48.870 --> 10:49.720
Fine, don't lend it to me, then.

232
10:49.720 --> 10:50.920
Why are you shouting?

233
10:57.750 --> 10:58.550
Dr. Yang!

234
10:59.080 --> 11:01.080
Keep an eye on things for me for a bit.

235
11:04.510 --> 11:05.910
Come on, come out with me.

236
11:10.960 --> 11:12.200
You like Gong Xue?

237
11:12.540 --> 11:20.670
[Accessible Route]

238
11:15.870 --> 11:17.600
Why did you come back this time?

239
11:17.750 --> 11:19.750
Junnan told me Jia Xin tried to end his life,

240
11:19.750 --> 11:21.350
so I came back to support him.

241
11:21.670 --> 11:22.480
He's fine now.

242
11:22.480 --> 11:23.360
You can go back.

243
11:25.150 --> 11:25.960
If I just leave like this,

244
11:25.960 --> 11:26.630
wouldn't it look like

245
11:26.630 --> 11:27.550
I'm taking it hard?

246
11:27.550 --> 11:29.150
What's there for you to take hard?

247
11:29.150 --> 11:30.680
Why are you so overbearing?

248
11:31.510 --> 11:32.870
Just because you like Gong Xue,

249
11:32.870 --> 11:34.480
does she have to like you back?

250
11:34.480 --> 11:35.740
I don't think that way.

251
11:36.270 --> 11:37.550
When I decided to go to Beijing,

252
11:37.550 --> 11:38.610
I'd already let go.

253
11:39.200 --> 11:41.460
But now that they're getting married...

254
11:42.720 --> 11:43.670
it still hurts.

255
11:43.670 --> 11:45.200
What's there to hurt about?

256
11:45.720 --> 11:46.750
I think you just have too much free time.

257
11:46.750 --> 11:47.550
Get back to Beijing.

258
11:47.550 --> 11:48.550
You'll feel better once you get busy.

259
11:48.550 --> 11:50.010
You were the one who told me

260
11:50.360 --> 11:52.220
to come back whenever I got tired.

261
11:53.870 --> 11:54.840
I did say that.

262
11:55.480 --> 11:56.550
But later Chen Junnan told me

263
11:56.550 --> 11:58.610
you were doing quite well in Beijing.

264
11:58.720 --> 11:59.910
Now that you've got a good opportunity,

265
11:59.910 --> 12:01.240
shouldn't you seize it?

266
12:03.750 --> 12:04.440
No.

267
12:05.120 --> 12:06.320
Jia Xin is my buddy.

268
12:06.320 --> 12:07.150
I got him the job

269
12:07.150 --> 12:08.080
at the crematorium.

270
12:08.080 --> 12:10.030
Now that things have turned out like this,

271
12:10.030 --> 12:12.160
I have to take responsibility for him.

272
12:16.000 --> 12:16.790
Zhengguang.

273
12:18.600 --> 12:20.870
He doesn't need you to take responsibility for him.

274
12:20.870 --> 12:22.400
Showing you care is enough.

275
12:25.440 --> 12:27.440
You really don't understand anything.

276
12:27.440 --> 12:29.170
It's pointless talking to you.

277
12:30.750 --> 12:31.670
You're leaving just like that?

278
12:31.670 --> 12:37.420
[Accessible Route]

279
12:32.000 --> 12:32.720
How about I prescribe you

280
12:32.720 --> 12:34.050
some antidepressants?

281
12:34.910 --> 12:36.240
Keep them for yourself.

282
12:37.850 --> 12:43.740
[Accessible Route]

283
12:50.150 --> 12:51.080
Uncle Che?

284
13:07.750 --> 13:08.510
Mr. Wang.

285
13:08.790 --> 13:10.080
Did you see

286
13:10.080 --> 13:12.080
the old man who came with me earlier?

287
13:12.870 --> 13:14.270
He went to his workplace.

288
13:14.840 --> 13:15.370
No, wait.

289
13:15.670 --> 13:17.730
Are we talking about the same person?

290
13:17.870 --> 13:19.000
Don't you know

291
13:19.000 --> 13:20.030
the old man's status?

292
13:20.030 --> 13:20.720
No, no.

293
13:21.480 --> 13:23.010
I was flustered and forgot.

294
13:23.030 --> 13:23.840
Forgot?

295
13:24.120 --> 13:25.000
Just because your boss

296
13:25.000 --> 13:26.000
is down-to-earth doesn't mean

297
13:26.000 --> 13:27.840
you should forget he's still your boss.

298
13:27.840 --> 13:28.510
Yes, yes.

299
13:28.600 --> 13:29.360
Well,

300
13:29.790 --> 13:30.720
did he give you

301
13:30.790 --> 13:32.030
the address of his workplace?

302
13:32.030 --> 13:33.440
I-I have to go pick him up.

303
13:33.810 --> 13:36.890
[Restricted Research Area; Authorized Personnel Only; No Photography; No Video Recording]

304
13:42.610 --> 13:52.350
[Beijing Texi]

305
13:45.030 --> 13:46.150
Here, sir.

306
13:46.200 --> 13:47.030
Thank you.

307
13:53.110 --> 14:01.330
[No Parking; Violators Will Be Heavily Penalized]

308
14:10.360 --> 14:12.160
Uncle Che, why did you come here?

309
14:18.120 --> 14:19.780
This is where you used to work?

310
14:25.750 --> 14:26.720
Stay here and don't go away.

311
14:26.720 --> 14:27.390
Wait for me.

312
14:35.030 --> 14:35.390
Hello.

313
14:35.390 --> 14:36.200
Hello, sir.

314
14:36.200 --> 14:37.080
Um...

315
14:38.510 --> 14:40.370
That old man across the street...

316
14:41.000 --> 14:42.000
Did he do anything

317
14:42.600 --> 14:43.910
strange?

318
14:44.200 --> 14:44.840
No.

319
14:44.840 --> 14:46.570
He's just been standing there.

320
14:49.910 --> 14:50.790
He's my dad.

321
14:51.480 --> 14:53.390
He has Alzheimer's.

322
14:53.750 --> 14:55.080
His memory

323
14:55.120 --> 14:57.000
comes and goes.

324
14:57.270 --> 14:57.840
Can you

325
14:57.840 --> 14:59.000
do me a favor in a bit?

326
14:59.200 --> 15:00.330
I'll bring him over,

327
15:00.390 --> 15:01.250
and I'll ask you

328
15:01.390 --> 15:03.510
if you know Comrade Changhai.

329
15:04.240 --> 15:05.360
Just say you do.

330
15:05.300 --> 15:07.860
[Public Welfare]

331
15:05.390 --> 15:06.360
Is that okay?

332
15:14.550 --> 15:15.360
Uncle Che.

333
15:15.480 --> 15:16.670
I asked the young guard

334
15:16.670 --> 15:17.480
over there.

335
15:17.550 --> 15:18.360
He said

336
15:18.360 --> 15:19.750
you used to work there.

337
15:20.360 --> 15:22.090
Let's go over and chat with him?

338
15:27.150 --> 15:28.080
Let's go back.

339
15:29.750 --> 15:30.840
Go back where?

340
15:41.270 --> 15:42.910
Back to the hotel.

341
15:44.550 --> 15:45.440
To the station.

342
15:47.240 --> 15:48.170
Back to Fucheng.

343
15:50.910 --> 15:52.510
We're already here.

344
15:52.910 --> 15:54.550
Let's go visit your old workplace.

345
15:54.550 --> 15:55.360
Let's go.

346
15:56.510 --> 15:57.440
There's no need.

347
16:08.030 --> 16:09.270
I'm retired.

348
16:09.970 --> 16:13.970
[Science City]

349
16:17.670 --> 16:20.360
Congratulations to Comrade Che Changhai

350
16:21.600 --> 16:23.260
on his honorable retirement!

351
16:36.750 --> 16:37.320
Junnan.

352
16:37.320 --> 16:38.000
Mingming.

353
16:38.390 --> 16:39.550
I just wanted to let you know

354
16:39.550 --> 16:40.720
your dad and I are at the station.

355
16:40.720 --> 16:42.440
We'll board in an hour.

356
16:42.870 --> 16:43.720
So, don't worry.

357
16:43.720 --> 16:44.850
Everything's fine.

358
16:45.200 --> 16:45.870
Thank you

359
16:45.870 --> 16:46.870
for taking care of my dad these past couple of days.

360
16:46.870 --> 16:48.070
It must've been hard.

361
16:48.320 --> 16:49.720
I'll treat you to a meal when you get back.

362
16:49.720 --> 16:50.720
It was no trouble.

363
16:53.030 --> 16:53.840
There's something

364
16:53.840 --> 16:55.370
I don't know how to tell you.

365
16:55.790 --> 16:57.190
What's wrong with my dad?

366
16:58.390 --> 16:58.870
Nothing.

367
16:58.870 --> 17:00.360
He's fine. Everything is normal.

368
17:00.360 --> 17:01.600
Is he acting up again?

369
17:02.030 --> 17:03.630
What ridiculous thing did he do this time?

370
17:03.630 --> 17:04.349
If he caused trouble

371
17:04.349 --> 17:04.829
and needs to pay compensation,

372
17:04.829 --> 17:05.750
you must tell me.

373
17:05.750 --> 17:06.829
I-I'll give you the money.

374
17:06.829 --> 17:07.680
No.

375
17:08.160 --> 17:09.160
Relax.

376
17:09.160 --> 17:09.960
It's just...

377
17:11.640 --> 17:14.569
He's been unusually quiet these past couple of days.

378
17:17.440 --> 17:19.839
His behavior and speech have been a bit off.

379
17:20.400 --> 17:22.530
Do you understand what I'm getting at?

380
17:22.680 --> 17:23.240
I don't.

381
17:24.720 --> 17:25.270
I...

382
17:26.069 --> 17:27.880
A-Anyway, as long as he's fine.

383
17:30.830 --> 17:31.680
Uncle Che.

384
17:33.680 --> 17:34.880
Read your newspaper.

385
17:37.110 --> 17:38.270
Eight pages.

386
17:38.590 --> 17:40.190
I've read all the headlines.

387
17:40.960 --> 17:41.510
There's nothing

388
17:41.510 --> 17:43.040
worth paying attention to.

389
17:44.880 --> 17:45.880
I'm done reading.

390
17:49.720 --> 17:50.440
Stop crying.

391
17:50.440 --> 17:52.770
We'll have your dad fix it when we get home.

392
17:54.920 --> 17:56.000
Stop crying!

393
17:56.200 --> 17:57.960
You dropped it yourself. Who can you blame?

394
17:57.960 --> 17:59.680
Hold it in! Your child...

395
18:00.510 --> 18:01.550
Do you hear me?

396
18:03.590 --> 18:04.200
I got it.

397
18:04.200 --> 18:05.860
What are you doing, Uncle Che?

398
18:08.200 --> 18:09.480
Do you hear me? Stop crying!

399
18:09.480 --> 18:10.270
Hold it in！

400
18:11.110 --> 18:12.040
Hey, little one.

401
18:13.640 --> 18:15.570
Let Grandpa show you a magic trick.

402
18:16.350 --> 18:17.160
A magic trick.

403
18:27.310 --> 18:28.310
Is that a good one?

404
18:29.000 --> 18:29.880
Here, take it.

405
18:29.880 --> 18:30.310
This... This...

406
18:30.310 --> 18:31.550
We can't take this. Thank you.

407
18:31.550 --> 18:32.200
We can't spoil the kid.

408
18:32.200 --> 18:32.880
Oh, come on.

409
18:32.880 --> 18:33.790
It's fate that we ended up

410
18:33.790 --> 18:34.990
in the same train car.

411
18:35.030 --> 18:35.480
It's just a handicraft.

412
18:35.480 --> 18:36.400
Not worth much.

413
18:36.400 --> 18:37.350
Here, take it.

414
18:39.240 --> 18:40.030
Is it fun?

415
18:41.000 --> 18:41.680
It's fun.

416
18:41.960 --> 18:42.680
Take it.

417
18:42.680 --> 18:43.940
Quick, thank Grandpa.

418
18:44.200 --> 18:45.070
Thank you, Grandpa.

419
18:45.070 --> 18:46.270
You're welcome.

420
18:46.680 --> 18:47.810
How old are you, kid?

421
18:47.920 --> 18:48.590
Eight.

422
18:48.680 --> 18:49.480
Impressive.

423
18:49.920 --> 18:51.000
What's your name?

424
18:51.350 --> 18:52.160
Xiaobo.

425
18:54.270 --> 18:55.270
What's your name?

426
18:55.400 --> 18:56.400
My name's Xiaobo.

427
19:00.830 --> 19:01.830
Well then...

428
19:02.310 --> 19:04.310
Study hard and keep striving to improve.

429
19:04.310 --> 19:05.240
Okay, that's it.

430
19:05.240 --> 19:06.000
Thank you.

431
19:12.750 --> 19:13.550
Uncle Che,

432
19:14.400 --> 19:15.530
why did you give away

433
19:16.350 --> 19:17.750
the organization's key?

434
19:18.830 --> 19:19.640
What organization?

435
19:19.640 --> 19:20.440
What key?

436
19:24.920 --> 19:25.720
Never mind.

437
19:25.720 --> 19:27.780
Just pretend I was talking nonsense.

438
19:29.590 --> 19:30.720
Commissioner Chen.

439
19:32.030 --> 19:32.920
Well, I was just focusing on

440
19:32.920 --> 19:34.310
looking at the scenery outside.

441
19:34.310 --> 19:36.910
Didn't you go to Beijing to discuss the patent?

442
19:37.440 --> 19:38.350
How did it go?

443
19:38.640 --> 19:39.700
It went quite well.

444
19:39.830 --> 19:42.490
Both sides are interested in working together.

445
19:42.640 --> 19:43.790
Good, good.

446
19:45.070 --> 19:45.830
Well...

447
19:48.070 --> 19:49.030
I actually know

448
19:49.030 --> 19:50.630
a thing or two about patents.

449
19:50.640 --> 19:52.200
You see, from filing the application

450
19:52.200 --> 19:54.880
to getting it approved,

451
19:55.030 --> 19:56.480
then moving into mass production

452
19:56.480 --> 19:58.030
and finally bringing the product to market.

453
19:58.030 --> 20:00.360
It's a very long and complicated process.

454
20:00.480 --> 20:01.940
It's better to be careful.

455
20:02.400 --> 20:04.060
You must do thorough research

456
20:04.070 --> 20:05.130
and stay cautious,

457
20:05.240 --> 20:06.570
then you won't go wrong.

458
20:08.830 --> 20:10.030
You're right.

459
20:19.640 --> 20:20.790
You must be exhausted. Get some good rest.

460
20:20.790 --> 20:21.480
I'm fine.

461
20:23.750 --> 20:24.550
Come on.

462
20:25.720 --> 20:26.880
It's so warmer inside.

463
20:26.880 --> 20:27.720
Uncle Che, Mingming,

464
20:27.720 --> 20:29.160
you two get some rest.

465
20:29.160 --> 20:30.000
I won't come in.

466
20:30.000 --> 20:30.440
I still have something to do.

467
20:30.440 --> 20:31.070
Thank you.

468
20:31.070 --> 20:32.270
No, no, don't go!

469
20:32.270 --> 20:32.960
Come in and sit for a while.

470
20:32.960 --> 20:34.480
I've got things to do. Really.

471
20:34.480 --> 20:35.680
You have things to do?

472
20:35.680 --> 20:36.480
Alright then.

473
20:36.640 --> 20:37.440
Junnan.

474
20:37.480 --> 20:38.350
Thank you for taking care of me

475
20:38.350 --> 20:39.350
in Beijing.

476
20:39.350 --> 20:39.950
Thank you.

477
20:40.790 --> 20:42.120
Thanks for what you did.

478
20:42.750 --> 20:44.160
Well, Junnan,

479
20:44.920 --> 20:46.790
I think you're so much better

480
20:46.790 --> 20:47.960
than Zhang Hao.

481
20:49.720 --> 20:51.250
Give our Mingming a chance.

482
20:51.400 --> 20:51.830
Mingming is...

483
20:51.830 --> 20:53.400
Dad, what are you talking about?

484
20:53.400 --> 20:54.640
What?

485
20:55.200 --> 20:55.960
I can't

486
20:55.960 --> 20:57.420
stay by your side forever.

487
20:57.550 --> 20:59.240
In the end, the world is a lonely place

488
20:59.240 --> 21:00.720
when you're all alone,

489
21:01.070 --> 21:01.640
right?

490
21:02.960 --> 21:05.240
As for the next action plan,

491
21:06.000 --> 21:07.240
I'll leave you two to discuss them.

492
21:07.240 --> 21:07.880
Okay.

493
21:08.310 --> 21:09.640
I'll go over it with her.

494
21:17.830 --> 21:19.030
So this is what you meant when you said

495
21:19.030 --> 21:20.160
his behavior was strangely normal?

496
21:20.160 --> 21:20.960
Can you tell

497
21:20.960 --> 21:22.960
when your dad is lucid and when he's not?

498
21:22.960 --> 21:23.790
I can.

499
21:27.000 --> 21:27.960
Uncle Che, what's wrong?

500
21:27.960 --> 21:28.680
Nothing.

501
21:28.960 --> 21:29.830
N-Nothing.

502
21:30.310 --> 21:31.310
You two continue.

503
21:35.880 --> 21:36.880
What exactly

504
21:36.880 --> 21:38.410
did you tell my dad about us?

505
21:38.830 --> 21:40.240
What's there between us?

506
21:45.350 --> 21:47.000
I really don't have the energy to think about...

507
21:47.000 --> 21:47.880
Okay, okay.

508
21:48.200 --> 21:49.480
I know.

509
21:49.750 --> 21:50.550
Don't worry.

510
21:50.880 --> 21:52.440
I won't put you on the spot.

511
22:02.720 --> 22:04.440
Whenever I come back to Fucheng,

512
22:04.440 --> 22:05.350
I always make a point of coming here

513
22:05.350 --> 22:06.750
to spend some time alone.

514
22:08.550 --> 22:10.010
Shenzhen also has the sea,

515
22:10.880 --> 22:13.210
but I still prefer the sea here in Fucheng.

516
22:13.310 --> 22:14.110
Why?

517
22:15.830 --> 22:17.290
I can't really explain it.

518
22:18.160 --> 22:19.750
Maybe all seas are the same,

519
22:20.400 --> 22:21.440
but I always feel

520
22:21.440 --> 22:22.310
there's a sweetness in the air

521
22:22.310 --> 22:23.270
here in Fucheng.

522
22:26.000 --> 22:26.790
And

523
22:26.830 --> 22:29.160
the colder it gets, the sweeter it smells.

524
22:32.680 --> 22:34.480
Actually, I've been dreaming about my mom a lot lately.

525
22:34.480 --> 22:35.270
Really?

526
22:35.880 --> 22:37.030
Ever since I came back,

527
22:37.030 --> 22:39.240
I've been dreaming about her all the time.

528
22:39.240 --> 22:40.970
Sometimes, it doesn't even...

529
22:41.790 --> 22:42.790
feel like a dream.

530
22:43.110 --> 22:44.160
It feels so real.

531
22:45.750 --> 22:47.400
Like she was sitting right beside me,

532
22:47.400 --> 22:48.310
talking to me.

533
22:50.960 --> 22:52.960
I even dreamed about her a few days ago.

534
22:52.960 --> 22:53.750
Really?

535
22:55.070 --> 22:55.750
But it seems like

536
22:55.750 --> 22:56.590
I've been dreaming about her

537
22:56.590 --> 22:57.790
less and less lately.

538
23:00.550 --> 23:01.720
Maybe that's thanks to me,

539
23:01.720 --> 23:02.550
huh?

540
23:04.550 --> 23:06.030
Because she's not so worried about you anymore,

541
23:06.030 --> 23:07.960
and she doesn't miss you quite so much.

542
23:07.960 --> 23:08.750
Right?

543
23:09.750 --> 23:10.680
Coming all this way

544
23:10.680 --> 23:11.960
back and forth must be

545
23:11.960 --> 23:13.090
exhausting for her.

546
23:17.510 --> 23:18.240
Once you get

547
23:18.240 --> 23:19.880
your reading disorder sorted out,

548
23:19.880 --> 23:21.440
what's the first thing you want to do?

549
23:21.440 --> 23:24.170
Definitely keep going with my driver's license.

550
23:25.000 --> 23:26.070
Although it's been pretty tough,

551
23:26.070 --> 23:27.680
learning while trying not to throw up,

552
23:27.680 --> 23:29.610
I'm finally making some progress.

553
23:30.110 --> 23:32.270
At least I passed the driving theory test.

554
23:32.270 --> 23:33.130
I'll keep at it.

555
23:34.590 --> 23:35.450
What about you?

556
23:36.550 --> 23:37.830
If your phobia could be completely cured,

557
23:37.830 --> 23:39.310
what would you want to do most?

558
23:39.310 --> 23:40.110
Me?

559
23:42.480 --> 23:44.680
What I want most is to see snow fall here.

560
23:45.510 --> 23:46.880
You want to see snow?

561
23:48.270 --> 23:49.480
My phone says

562
23:49.480 --> 23:51.110
it'll snow early this month.

563
23:51.790 --> 23:53.120
Let me take you to see it.

564
23:53.920 --> 23:55.720
Aren't you afraid I'll pass out?

565
23:55.830 --> 23:57.350
Wouldn't that be perfect?

566
23:59.750 --> 24:00.680
What do you mean?

567
24:00.680 --> 24:02.080
I'd go get us a hotel room.

568
24:02.720 --> 24:04.160
A snow-view room.

569
24:11.680 --> 24:12.510
Indeed.

570
24:12.510 --> 24:13.680
You're indeed much more interesting

571
24:13.680 --> 24:15.010
than my ex-girlfriend.

572
24:17.480 --> 24:18.740
What's wrong with you?

573
24:21.200 --> 24:21.830
I should just

574
24:21.830 --> 24:23.240
slap you into the sea!

575
24:24.310 --> 24:25.570
Do you know how to talk?

576
24:26.110 --> 24:26.830
What a stupid question!

577
24:26.830 --> 24:29.090
Of course I'm more interesting than her!

578
24:33.590 --> 24:35.520
I think you're quite interesting.

579
25:20.160 --> 25:21.110
The paperwork's all done.

580
25:21.110 --> 25:21.910
Let's go home.

581
25:24.350 --> 25:25.810
I'm going to the restroom.

582
25:26.270 --> 25:27.160
Want me to come with you?

583
25:27.160 --> 25:27.590
It's fine.

584
25:27.590 --> 25:28.790
I can manage on my own.

585
25:38.270 --> 25:39.270
I'll go too.

586
25:39.270 --> 25:41.200
I'll leave the papers here for you.

587
25:57.830 --> 25:58.640
Jia,

588
25:59.070 --> 26:00.330
which stall are you in?

589
26:05.440 --> 26:06.240
Here.

590
26:06.830 --> 26:07.830
I'll be right out.

591
26:08.160 --> 26:09.030
No rush.

592
26:13.440 --> 26:14.570
Are you scared of me?

593
26:15.200 --> 26:16.130
What? Am I crazy?

594
26:16.590 --> 26:17.480
You're my buddy.

595
26:17.480 --> 26:19.010
Why would I be scared of you?

596
26:20.880 --> 26:22.160
Do I look scarier

597
26:22.160 --> 26:23.270
than a ghost now?

598
26:25.590 --> 26:28.320
Then you're giving ghosts way too little credit.

599
26:35.160 --> 26:37.560
You say that like you've actually seen one.

600
26:40.720 --> 26:41.510
It's fine.

601
26:42.000 --> 26:42.880
My brother said

602
26:42.880 --> 26:44.210
you can get a skin graft.

603
26:46.590 --> 26:47.720
It's too expensive.

604
26:48.640 --> 26:50.500
And I'd need several operations.

605
26:52.680 --> 26:53.400
Let it be.

606
26:53.400 --> 26:54.260
I won't have it.

607
26:56.240 --> 26:58.550
You can't decide not to have it just like that.

608
26:58.550 --> 27:00.030
Wait until we get rich.

609
27:00.030 --> 27:01.090
When we have money,

610
27:01.310 --> 27:02.160
you can get

611
27:02.440 --> 27:03.900
as many grafts as you want.

612
27:03.920 --> 27:04.720
Right?

613
27:10.550 --> 27:12.480
I'll never make it big in this life.

614
27:14.160 --> 27:16.030
Looking... Looking like this,

615
27:16.030 --> 27:17.630
no one will hire me anywhere.

616
27:20.550 --> 27:21.810
Maybe in the next life.

617
27:26.790 --> 27:27.590
Jia Xin.

618
27:29.160 --> 27:30.160
I'm officially extending

619
27:30.160 --> 27:31.750
an invitation to you today.

620
27:32.350 --> 27:34.010
I'm going to start a business.

621
27:34.160 --> 27:35.550
I really need you.

622
27:35.590 --> 27:37.190
And I can't do it without you.

623
27:37.720 --> 27:38.550
I'm telling you, if you don't come on board,

624
27:38.550 --> 27:40.000
the whole business is going to fall apart.

625
27:40.000 --> 27:41.530
Can you help your buddy out?

626
28:03.310 --> 28:04.770
You're back, Zhengliang.

627
28:05.920 --> 28:06.720
Come here.

628
28:07.480 --> 28:09.540
I need to discuss something with you.

629
28:11.200 --> 28:12.110
What's wrong?

630
28:15.070 --> 28:15.880
Go ahead.

631
28:16.030 --> 28:16.890
I'm listening.

632
28:20.920 --> 28:22.520
I want to sell the apartment.

633
28:24.200 --> 28:25.000
Okay.

634
28:26.030 --> 28:27.290
You agreed so readily.

635
28:27.920 --> 28:30.320
So you have no feelings for this place, huh?

636
28:30.920 --> 28:32.680
Zhengguang, you know me.

637
28:33.440 --> 28:34.700
I've never been good at

638
28:35.110 --> 28:37.440
expressing myself, ever since I was a kid.

639
28:37.640 --> 28:38.640
But I'm human too.

640
28:39.000 --> 28:40.460
Of course I have feelings.

641
28:41.440 --> 28:42.350
My feelings

642
28:43.000 --> 28:43.920
are for Mom

643
28:44.750 --> 28:45.510
and you,

644
28:46.440 --> 28:48.100
not for some physical object.

645
28:50.070 --> 28:50.880
Besides, last time you said

646
28:50.880 --> 28:52.350
you wanted to go to Beijing,

647
28:52.350 --> 28:54.680
didn't I agree to sell this place then too?

648
28:56.400 --> 28:57.110
Now that you've

649
28:57.110 --> 28:58.270
brought it up again,

650
28:58.830 --> 29:00.690
you must really be short on money.

651
29:01.920 --> 29:02.880
So let's sell it.

652
29:05.310 --> 29:06.680
I can rent a place

653
29:07.310 --> 29:08.370
near the hospital.

654
29:08.830 --> 29:10.790
Rent in Fucheng is cheap anyway.

655
29:13.270 --> 29:14.070
It's fine.

656
29:15.160 --> 29:17.420
Rent is cheap, but so are housing prices.

657
29:18.110 --> 29:19.910
It probably won't sell for much.

658
29:20.350 --> 29:21.750
I don't know if it'll be enough.

659
29:21.750 --> 29:22.680
What do you mean?

660
29:23.680 --> 29:24.350
What are you planning?

661
29:24.350 --> 29:25.950
Why do you need so much money?

662
29:27.590 --> 29:29.750
I'm... not going back to Beijing.

663
29:30.440 --> 29:31.590
I'm staying in Fucheng

664
29:31.590 --> 29:33.120
and start a small business.

665
29:33.240 --> 29:34.880
You have to think this through.

666
29:34.880 --> 29:35.680
Some opportunities, once missed,

667
29:35.680 --> 29:36.480
are gone.

668
29:36.550 --> 29:38.210
Don't regret it in a few years.

669
29:39.160 --> 29:40.560
I've thought it through.

670
29:41.160 --> 29:41.920
Although I

671
29:42.200 --> 29:44.130
didn't spend very long in Beijing,

672
29:44.750 --> 29:46.350
I suddenly understood what it's like

673
29:46.350 --> 29:47.240
to be alone in a strange city,

674
29:47.240 --> 29:49.240
with no friends or family to turn to.

675
29:50.160 --> 29:50.920
I finally understand

676
29:50.920 --> 29:51.510
how hard it's been for you

677
29:51.510 --> 29:53.160
all these years, living alone

678
29:53.160 --> 29:53.960
in the South.

679
29:54.160 --> 29:55.000
Hold on.

680
29:56.160 --> 29:57.490
I don't have any friends

681
29:57.550 --> 29:59.610
because I don't want to make friends.

682
30:01.160 --> 30:02.560
What are you laughing at?

683
30:02.920 --> 30:03.830
As you work hard

684
30:03.830 --> 30:04.680
to build a better future,

685
30:04.680 --> 30:05.480
you'll definitely meet

686
30:05.480 --> 30:07.340
new friends who share your goals.

687
30:08.240 --> 30:09.200
Besides,

688
30:09.350 --> 30:10.640
you haven't known Jia Xin

689
30:10.640 --> 30:11.550
for that long.

690
30:14.350 --> 30:15.480
I've made up my mind.

691
30:15.590 --> 30:16.480
I have to stay

692
30:17.030 --> 30:17.960
and help Jia Xin.

693
30:20.960 --> 30:22.560
How are you going to help him?

694
30:23.920 --> 30:26.110
What kind of business could you start that would help him?

695
30:26.110 --> 30:27.840
I haven't figured that out yet.

696
30:28.920 --> 30:29.850
Liu Zhengguang.

697
30:32.200 --> 30:32.790
This isn't a decision

698
30:32.790 --> 30:34.390
you've made on your own, huh?

699
30:35.590 --> 30:36.400
You're worried he won't

700
30:36.400 --> 30:37.930
be able to find a decent job?

701
30:45.110 --> 30:46.920
You're getting ahead of yourself.

702
30:46.920 --> 30:48.240
Does he even need your help?

703
30:48.240 --> 30:49.270
I got Jia Xin

704
30:49.270 --> 30:50.800
the job at the crematorium.

705
30:55.030 --> 30:56.030
Say you come across someone on the road

706
30:56.030 --> 30:56.960
who's sick,

707
30:57.200 --> 30:58.200
and you take him to the hospital,

708
30:58.200 --> 30:59.920
but the doctors failed to save him.

709
30:59.920 --> 31:00.960
Does that make it your fault?

710
31:00.960 --> 31:01.400
That's

711
31:01.400 --> 31:02.510
not the same thing.

712
31:02.510 --> 31:03.680
How is it not the same thing?

713
31:03.680 --> 31:05.210
Being responsible is good,

714
31:05.270 --> 31:05.880
but you can't take responsibility

715
31:05.880 --> 31:07.540
for everything that happens.

716
31:07.750 --> 31:08.510
What about you, then?

717
31:08.510 --> 31:09.030
What about me?

718
31:09.030 --> 31:10.270
Dad took you out to play,

719
31:10.270 --> 31:11.640
showed off, and died.

720
31:12.240 --> 31:13.200
What did that have to do with you?

721
31:13.200 --> 31:14.000
Why have you been unable to

722
31:14.000 --> 31:15.530
get past it all these years?

723
31:24.160 --> 31:24.960
I'm sorry.

724
31:26.310 --> 31:28.910
I shouldn't have compared the two situations.

725
31:39.030 --> 31:39.830
It's okay.

726
31:42.000 --> 31:42.830
You're right.

727
31:44.400 --> 31:46.460
Dad's death had nothing to do with me.

728
31:48.400 --> 31:49.110
And Jia Xin's burns

729
31:49.110 --> 31:51.040
have nothing to do with you either.

730
31:51.350 --> 31:52.160
I know.

731
31:53.310 --> 31:54.160
I know too.

732
32:02.790 --> 32:04.120
I'm really speechless.

733
32:05.680 --> 32:07.480
That DNA test was a waste of time.

734
32:08.790 --> 32:11.250
We really are brothers through and through.

735
32:12.340 --> 32:15.490
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

736
32:15.940 --> 32:19.110
♪ Welcome to this city of haste ♪

737
32:19.550 --> 32:21.910
♪ Grow taller, quick as you can ♪

738
32:22.210 --> 32:24.470
♪ Learn how to find your footing ♪

739
32:23.240 --> 32:24.570
This bedroom's decent.

740
32:25.270 --> 32:26.350
Let's have a look at the living room.

741
32:26.350 --> 32:27.000
Okay.

742
32:26.680 --> 32:30.110
♪ A soul who hid among the lanes and alleys ♪

743
32:27.400 --> 32:28.600
Go check the balcony.

744
32:29.680 --> 32:30.830
Even the TV

745
32:30.510 --> 32:33.780
♪ A single turn, and the lamp at the door grows distant ♪

746
32:31.000 --> 32:32.470
was bought new this year.

747
32:33.440 --> 32:36.110
And the entire place has a river view.

748
32:34.110 --> 32:36.500
♪ The ticket bears no way back ♪

749
32:36.270 --> 32:37.550
The natural light is excellent too.

750
32:36.790 --> 32:39.180
♪ How like life it is ♪

751
32:37.640 --> 32:40.040
Isn't that the crematorium across the way?

752
32:41.280 --> 32:44.630
♪ You'll pass through the seasons, through dawn and dusk ♪

753
32:44.970 --> 32:48.170
♪ Hearing someone call your name, again and again ♪

754
32:48.490 --> 32:50.940
♪ These ties may hurt a little ♪

755
32:51.380 --> 32:53.590
♪ Don't heal a broken heart ♪

756
32:55.860 --> 32:59.130
♪ It will bear witness to the life you bravely lived ♪

757
32:59.380 --> 33:02.750
♪ To the beautiful souls you've loved ♪

758
33:03.040 --> 33:05.550
♪ To the address you call home ♪

759
33:04.060 --> 33:05.190
[Submit]

760
33:05.290 --> 33:05.900
[Payment Status: Paid]

761
33:05.760 --> 33:08.520
♪ In the little town you've wandered through ♪

762
33:05.920 --> 33:07.210
Review Status: Submitted; Pending Review by the Examining Authority]

763
33:07.230 --> 33:09.060
[Chaoyang Medical University] [PhD Application System]

764
33:11.280 --> 33:13.730
♪ The wind in the city ♪

765
33:14.050 --> 33:16.790
♪ Blows through dreams that flicker between light and dark ♪

766
33:17.680 --> 33:20.540
♪ Blows through one soul's radiance ♪

767
33:22.000 --> 33:24.510
♪ And all its weathered scars ♪

768
33:25.890 --> 33:28.160
♪ Blows through the depths of winter ♪

769
33:28.450 --> 33:31.400
♪ Stumbling along in the wind ♪

770
33:32.160 --> 33:34.930
♪ Flickering along in the wind ♪

771
33:36.540 --> 33:42.470
♪ Toward the crossroads brimming with sunlight ♪

772
33:41.200 --> 33:42.720
Here, the keys.

773
33:45.830 --> 33:49.280
♪ May every road you take be safe ♪

774
33:49.580 --> 33:53.610
♪ May the scenery stay simple and carry you past regret ♪

775
33:54.180 --> 33:57.160
♪ Love deeply whatever comes to meet you ♪

776
33:57.690 --> 34:00.760
♪ And let those who leave be buried under snow on the hills ♪

777
34:01.410 --> 34:03.950
♪ May you come home covered in dust ♪

778
34:04.160 --> 34:08.040
♪ Held by what you love as you roam the world and return ♪

779
34:09.179 --> 34:13.510
♪ Saying she was so beautiful in front of the door ♪

780
34:12.920 --> 34:13.710
Alright.

781
34:14.550 --> 34:15.360
We're here.

782
34:15.760 --> 34:17.760
This whole building is ours.

783
34:24.280 --> 34:25.760
The tumor is flanked by

784
34:25.760 --> 34:27.000
large draining veins.

785
34:27.000 --> 34:29.150
The one behind it should be the central sulcus vein.

786
34:29.150 --> 34:30.280
We have to protect it.

787
34:30.280 --> 34:31.280
Set the bipolar forceps to 15.

788
34:31.280 --> 34:32.000
Okay.

789
34:32.190 --> 34:33.030
Get the microsurgical dissector

790
34:33.030 --> 34:34.000
and scissors ready.

791
34:34.000 --> 34:34.670
Okay.

792
34:35.000 --> 34:36.960
I'll first free the draining vein

793
34:37.000 --> 34:39.000
and then sever the tumor base

794
34:39.000 --> 34:40.130
on the falx cerebri.

795
34:40.760 --> 34:42.070
After decompressing the area by removing

796
34:42.070 --> 34:44.190
the tumor in sections, I'll expose the motor cortex.

797
34:44.190 --> 34:45.590
That's a good plan.

798
34:46.960 --> 34:49.400
But freeing the vein is delicate work.

799
34:50.000 --> 34:50.800
Be careful.

800
34:51.110 --> 34:51.960
Don't worry.

801
34:53.000 --> 34:54.060
Micro-dissector.

802
34:57.030 --> 34:57.840
Liu,

803
34:58.070 --> 34:58.880
has

804
34:59.030 --> 35:01.160
President Long contacted you lately?

805
35:01.360 --> 35:02.150
No.

806
35:03.960 --> 35:05.070
It's very strange.

807
35:05.400 --> 35:06.110
Usually,

808
35:06.110 --> 35:07.550
such a show-off,

809
35:07.920 --> 35:09.280
and suddenly not a peep.

810
35:09.280 --> 35:10.410
No one can reach him.

811
35:11.150 --> 35:13.920
Is he really going to retire completely?

812
35:14.150 --> 35:14.960
Let him retire.

813
35:14.960 --> 35:16.290
Isn't that a good thing?

814
35:16.510 --> 35:17.440
That won't do.

815
35:18.960 --> 35:20.960
If President Long retires for good,

816
35:21.150 --> 35:22.280
won't Huang go from acting president

817
35:22.280 --> 35:23.800
to full president?

818
35:24.150 --> 35:25.080
What a headache.

819
35:25.400 --> 35:26.400
Micro-scissors.

820
35:27.630 --> 35:28.440
What?

821
35:28.630 --> 35:30.430
You have a grudge against Huang?

822
35:30.480 --> 35:31.280
No.

823
35:31.480 --> 35:32.710
Don't make things up.

824
35:34.000 --> 35:35.230
What I mean is,

825
35:35.230 --> 35:37.480
we were all colleagues.

826
35:38.030 --> 35:40.440
Huang's professional title isn't even higher than mine,

827
35:40.440 --> 35:42.590
and suddenly he becomes the president.

828
35:42.590 --> 35:44.960
And he's getting more and more high-handed by the day.

829
35:44.960 --> 35:46.000
Such a poser.

830
35:46.400 --> 35:47.670
I actually think

831
35:48.070 --> 35:50.110
Huang is quite suitable to be the president.

832
35:50.110 --> 35:50.880
Why?

833
35:51.880 --> 35:53.080
Haven't you noticed?

834
35:53.630 --> 35:56.230
He's getting more and more like Long Dongdong.

835
35:59.400 --> 36:00.400
President Huang.

836
36:04.070 --> 36:04.880
Hello, President Huang.

837
36:04.880 --> 36:05.550
Hello.

838
36:11.590 --> 36:12.400
President.

839
36:13.230 --> 36:13.960
Long.

840
36:13.960 --> 36:15.280
Where have you been?

841
36:15.320 --> 36:16.520
Keep your voice down.

842
36:16.840 --> 36:18.280
I missed you so much.

843
36:18.960 --> 36:19.760
Well...

844
36:19.840 --> 36:21.670
Since you became the new president,

845
36:21.670 --> 36:23.270
you've been quite busy, huh?

846
36:23.360 --> 36:25.620
It's been a while since we had a drink, eh?

847
36:25.800 --> 36:27.660
President, you're finally back.

848
36:28.030 --> 36:29.230
You have no idea how much

849
36:29.230 --> 36:30.440
-what happened in the hospital... -Don't tell me!

850
36:30.440 --> 36:32.030
I don't want to hear it.

851
36:33.320 --> 36:34.190
Alright then.

852
36:34.190 --> 36:35.320
I'll report to you tomorrow.

853
36:35.320 --> 36:36.360
Whenever you report to me,

854
36:36.360 --> 36:37.220
I won't listen.

855
36:38.150 --> 36:40.350
Besides, you don't have to report to me.

856
36:40.630 --> 36:41.630
Well, so you came back...

857
36:41.630 --> 36:42.550
came back specifically,

858
36:42.550 --> 36:43.920
j-just to drink with me?

859
36:43.920 --> 36:44.850
Come on, cheers.

860
36:53.590 --> 36:54.230
Lately

861
36:54.230 --> 36:56.560
I've been watching the weather forecast.

862
36:57.480 --> 36:59.920
Looks like a big snow is coming.

863
37:04.030 --> 37:05.400
Now I finally get it.

864
37:05.400 --> 37:07.800
You're worried about Liu Zhengliang, huh?

865
37:08.030 --> 37:09.230
C-Can I ask you something?

866
37:09.230 --> 37:11.030
Why do you care about him so much?

867
37:11.590 --> 37:12.990
Don't you care about him?

868
37:14.110 --> 37:14.800
I've heard

869
37:14.800 --> 37:16.360
that since you became the president,

870
37:16.360 --> 37:17.890
you've been sending people

871
37:17.920 --> 37:19.070
to stock up on

872
37:19.070 --> 37:20.400
all kinds of daily necessities

873
37:20.400 --> 37:22.400
in the storage room he's staying in.

874
37:23.150 --> 37:24.320
Isn't his apartment gone now?

875
37:24.320 --> 37:25.780
Since it's gone, I just...

876
37:26.070 --> 37:27.800
He hasn't found a new place yet,

877
37:27.960 --> 37:29.590
so I got him some things.

878
37:29.590 --> 37:31.190
I'll help him in any way I can.

879
37:31.230 --> 37:32.710
This kid Liu Zhengliang…

880
37:34.190 --> 37:34.710
You...

881
37:34.800 --> 37:35.840
This person, j-just...

882
37:35.840 --> 37:36.630
He's...

883
37:37.230 --> 37:39.110
When you first meet him and get to know him,

884
37:39.110 --> 37:40.710
his personality and temper

885
37:40.710 --> 37:41.670
can seem pretty difficult,

886
37:41.670 --> 37:42.440
you know?

887
37:42.510 --> 37:44.370
But once you've known him a while,

888
37:44.590 --> 37:45.510
you'll find

889
37:46.400 --> 37:47.930
he's really kind-hearted.

890
37:49.030 --> 37:50.760
I knew I wasn't wrong about you.

891
38:02.670 --> 38:05.110
Look, the doctors at our Xiaoximen Hospital

892
38:05.110 --> 38:06.240
might not be the best

893
38:06.440 --> 38:08.240
when it comes to medical skills.

894
38:09.190 --> 38:10.190
But I think

895
38:11.550 --> 38:13.070
even the finest medical skills

896
38:13.070 --> 38:14.550
can't replace human touch.

897
38:14.550 --> 38:15.230
Right.

898
38:16.030 --> 38:17.400
It's not only hospitals with the best doctors

899
38:17.400 --> 38:19.530
that deserve to keep their doors open.

900
38:19.840 --> 38:20.630
Long.

901
38:21.360 --> 38:22.360
This one's to you.

902
38:22.360 --> 38:23.230
Don't toast me.

903
38:23.440 --> 38:25.100
Toast to Xiaoximen Hospital.

904
38:26.110 --> 38:27.440
To Xiaoximen Hospital.

905
38:43.670 --> 38:44.670
Are you nervous?

906
38:46.670 --> 38:47.760
I'm not nervous.

907
38:48.440 --> 38:49.240
Just awkward.

908
38:52.110 --> 38:53.370
You asked them to come?

909
38:54.400 --> 38:55.920
They knew it was going to snow,

910
38:55.920 --> 38:57.320
so they came on their own.

911
38:58.510 --> 38:59.510
Really!

912
39:01.510 --> 39:02.760
Why do I keep losing?

913
39:02.760 --> 39:04.020
Because you're a noob.

914
39:04.920 --> 39:05.880
Practice more if you're a noob.

915
39:05.880 --> 39:06.320
Exactly.

916
39:06.320 --> 39:07.880
When have you ever won?

917
39:08.030 --> 39:09.230
What do you mean?

918
39:09.230 --> 39:10.000
You don't want us here

919
39:10.000 --> 39:11.000
because we're getting in the way

920
39:11.000 --> 39:11.920
of you two dating, huh?

921
39:11.920 --> 39:12.800
Not that.

922
39:13.670 --> 39:14.840
Don't you guys have things of your own

923
39:14.840 --> 39:15.590
to do?

924
39:15.840 --> 39:17.840
It's not like we can't spare one day.

925
39:18.630 --> 39:19.440
We've only got

926
39:19.510 --> 39:21.240
about 30,000 days in this life.

927
39:21.590 --> 39:23.710
We should spend them however makes us happy.

928
39:23.710 --> 39:24.960
Look, I even brought my guitar today

929
39:24.960 --> 39:26.400
to liven things up.

930
39:26.510 --> 39:27.670
I finished delivering goods for my sis,

931
39:27.670 --> 39:28.870
and had nowhere to go,

932
39:29.320 --> 39:30.920
so I came to hang out with you.

933
39:31.280 --> 39:33.360
Everyone saw the weather forecast,

934
39:33.360 --> 39:34.440
knew it was going to snow today,

935
39:34.440 --> 39:35.500
and came to see you.

936
39:36.230 --> 39:37.230
But not me.

937
39:37.230 --> 39:38.400
I sold my apartment,

938
39:38.400 --> 39:39.530
so now I'm homeless.

939
39:40.070 --> 39:41.470
Well, thank you for that.

940
39:41.760 --> 39:44.000
If the snow really starts falling,

941
39:44.320 --> 39:45.360
and you're fine,

942
39:45.480 --> 39:45.840
can we

943
39:45.840 --> 39:46.920
go back then?

944
39:47.030 --> 39:48.230
What if I'm not fine then?

945
39:48.230 --> 39:48.760
If you are,

946
39:48.760 --> 39:50.190
we'll carry you straight to the hospital.

947
39:50.190 --> 39:51.230
Aren't we already at the hospital?

948
39:51.230 --> 39:52.880
Why are you such a killjoy?

949
39:53.110 --> 39:54.000
We came all this way to see you,

950
39:54.000 --> 39:54.880
and now you're trying to drive us away?

951
39:54.880 --> 39:56.550
I didn't drive anyone away, didn't I?

952
39:56.550 --> 39:57.440
Hurry up and play your cards.

953
39:57.440 --> 39:58.320
This round, I'm going to

954
39:58.320 --> 39:59.800
win back everything I've lost.

955
39:59.800 --> 40:01.200
You go. You lost just now.

956
40:02.030 --> 40:02.760
Play your cards.

957
40:02.760 --> 40:03.590
I'll go. I'll go.

958
40:03.590 --> 40:04.320
Let him play.

959
40:04.400 --> 40:05.800
You don't even know who goes first,

960
40:05.800 --> 40:06.280
and you're still playing...

961
40:06.280 --> 40:07.150
Stop talking. Hurry.

962
40:07.150 --> 40:08.630
That's how the pros play.

963
40:08.630 --> 40:09.360
One.

964
40:09.360 --> 40:10.230
I had several jokers last round,

965
40:10.230 --> 40:11.480
but this round, none.

966
40:11.480 --> 40:12.110
Six.

967
40:13.710 --> 40:14.510
Joker.

968
40:14.550 --> 40:16.070
-What are you doing? -What are you doing?

969
40:16.070 --> 40:16.480
Joker.

970
40:16.480 --> 40:17.630
What are you doing?

971
40:17.270 --> 40:20.640
♪ The melting snow and the warm wind ♪

972
40:17.630 --> 40:18.320
You have a killer hand or something?

973
40:18.320 --> 40:19.280
What the heck is your hands?

974
40:19.280 --> 40:20.070
What do you mean?

975
40:20.070 --> 40:20.920
Why do you have so many cards?

976
40:20.830 --> 40:23.130
♪ The flowers bloom again ♪

977
40:20.920 --> 40:22.230
Why do you have so many cards?

978
40:22.230 --> 40:23.760
Wait for me to sort my cards!

979
40:24.400 --> 40:26.100
♪ You and I ♪

980
40:28.040 --> 40:30.670
♪ Travel light ♪

981
40:32.000 --> 40:38.060
♪ Put the past weighing on my back into the moon ♪

982
40:39.470 --> 40:44.630
♪ Longing makes me wake up ♪

983
40:45.430 --> 40:49.350
♪ To the open window♪

984
40:50.110 --> 40:56.740
♪ Softly, the person in my dream is like the moonlight ♪

985
40:57.340 --> 41:01.480
♪ Falling on my heart softly and taking me ♪

986
40:57.590 --> 41:01.290
[Smart Healthcare, A Better Future; Your Health, Our Commitment]

987
41:01.720 --> 41:04.280
♪ To our old familiar place ♪

988
41:04.980 --> 41:11.370
♪ Slowly, the petals falls to the center of the lake when I miss you ♪

989
41:12.250 --> 41:16.320
♪ Ripples echo through the years, with our shadows faced each other ♪

990
41:12.280 --> 41:13.540
It's not going to snow.

991
41:13.760 --> 41:14.840
You should head back.

992
41:14.840 --> 41:15.510
Exactly.

993
41:15.510 --> 41:16.480
Go back and rest.

994
41:16.700 --> 41:22.050
♪ We were together on the way we came ♪

995
41:16.960 --> 41:18.070
I'm off to the internet cafe, sis!

996
41:18.070 --> 41:19.280
Call me if you need anything!

997
41:19.280 --> 41:21.080
Don't stay out playing too late!

998
41:30.280 --> 41:32.540
Where are you going? I'll give you a ride.

999
41:32.550 --> 41:34.280
No need. I'll just get a cab.

1000
41:40.190 --> 41:41.590
You sang really well.

1001
41:59.400 --> 42:01.000
I'll leave it here for you, okay?

1002
42:01.000 --> 42:02.360
Okay, leave it there.

1003
42:11.840 --> 42:12.670
Thank you.

1004
42:15.280 --> 42:17.760
Thank you for being willing to like me,

1005
42:19.190 --> 42:20.880
someone who is cold, dull,

1006
42:21.110 --> 42:22.360
boring, fragile,

1007
42:22.960 --> 42:24.280
arrogant, conceited,

1008
42:25.440 --> 42:27.770
and someone who still needs to hibernate.

1009
42:35.840 --> 42:37.970
I've wanted to say this for a long time.

1010
42:42.440 --> 42:43.230
Ai Chen.

1011
42:46.190 --> 42:47.110
I like you.
